        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Colonies: New Hampshire, New York\n- People: John Cruger Jr.\n- Events: New Hampshire Grants dispute, border skirmishes and raids\n- Places: Northeast coast of North America\n\nFacts:\n- Between 1701 and 1765, New Hampshire and New York had a series of skirmishes and raids along a disputed border.\n- New York was the British proprietary colony in this dispute.\n- John Cruger Jr. served as Speaker for New York.\n- New York later became a royal colony on the northeast coast of North America.",
